        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>[2.0.0-beta.3] - 2026-10-07</h2>
<h3>⚡ Performance Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>logging:</strong> Limit the appender buffer to 4096 lines (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5728612223" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5636" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5636/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5636">#5636</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5636" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5636/hovercard">#5636</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>proxies:</strong> Send only the delay records the frontend reads (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5729261926" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5643" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5643/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5643">#5643</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5643" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5643/hovercard">#5643</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>proxies:</strong> Hash cache fingerprints without retaining JSON (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5729043112" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5640" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5640/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5640">#5640</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5640" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5640/hovercard">#5640</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>runtime:</strong> Serialize the runtime document once and share it (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5732512378" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5663" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5663/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5663">#5663</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5663" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5663/hovercard">#5663</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>runtime:</strong> Keep runtime builds as stored snapshot graphs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5732511545" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5662" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5662/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5662">#5662</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5662" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5662/hovercard">#5662</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>runtime:</strong> Share nyanpasu-utils runtime with Tauri (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5728681059" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5638" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5638/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5638">#5638</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5638" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5638/hovercard">#5638</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>storage:</strong> Increase SourceForge and Telegram upload concurrency by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></p>
</li>
