<p><strong>core:</strong> Add Meow Alpha and fix core version detection (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5717811436" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5612" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5612/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5612">#5612</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5612" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5612/hovercard">#5612</a></p>
