<li>
<p><strong>migration:</strong> Stamp the app config with the schema revision it holds (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5731234451" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5646" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5646/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5646">#5646</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5646" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5646/hovercard">#5646</a></p>
