<li>
<p><strong>profiling:</strong> Add trace-chrome and dhat-heap profiling features (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5724451999" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5628" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5628/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5628">#5628</a>) by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a>  in <a href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5628" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5628/hovercard">#5628</a></p>
