        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><p>Clash Nyanpasu 2.0 is a major release featuring a substantially redesigned application architecture, a new Material You–inspired interface, a rewritten profile/runtime pipeline, improved traffic analytics, and extensive performance and reliability work.</p>
<p>This is the first beta release of the 2.0 series. Some regressions and incomplete features may still exist.</p>
<h2>Highlights</h2>
<h3>Completely redesigned interface</h3>
<p>Clash Nyanpasu 2.0 introduces a redesigned Material You–inspired interface and a new frontend architecture.</p>
<ul>
<li>Rebuilt the main application layout and experimental UI structure — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a></li>
<li>Added the new Dashboard with configurable widgets — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a></li>
<li>Added daily dashboard widgets and expanded the widget library — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5684523907" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5566" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5566/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5566">#5566</a></li>
<li>Added the new Profiles page — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3765773383" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/3987" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/3987/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/3987">#3987</a></li>
