<li>Exposed session traffic through the client facade — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5650451955" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5479" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5479/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5479">#5479</a></li>
<li>Added time-bucketed traffic history with retention — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/greenhat616/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/greenhat616">@greenhat616</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5660664984" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/5518" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5518/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/5518">#5518</a></li>
